  <Task>
    <Title>Set &quot;_BESGather_Download_CacheLimitMB&quot; to &quot;307200&quot; - Universal</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This task will set a client setting</P>
<P>This task was automatically generated using the task: "RESTAPI: Generate tasks to set client settings on target computer - Windows"</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>]]></Description>
